{"id": "EUVD-2026-96916", "enisaUuid": "b8280f25-51dd-3977-bac5-51e9cb7f3be9", "description": "MoAI-ADK through 3.1.2 contains an improper link resolution vulnerability in the moai init template deployer that allows malicious repositories to overwrite files outside the project via a symlinked .moai-tmp staging path. Attackers can commit a symlink such as .claude/settings.json.moai-tmp so atomicWriteFile truncates and overwrites victim-writable files with MoAI template content.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T12:19:51", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T13:33:19", "baseScore": 4.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind/moai-adk-template-staging-symlink-overwrite", "https://github.com/modu-ai/moai-adk/blob/4b2f203feda9c2cb6d7771969f4ec966842c8732/internal/template/deployer.go#L19-L32", "https://github.com/modu-ai/moai-adk/blob/4b2f203feda9c2cb6d7771969f4ec966842c8732/internal/template/deployer.go#L160-L203", "https://github.com/modu-ai/moai-adk", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/moai-adk-through-3.1.2-symlink-following-via-moai-init-template-deployer"], "aliases": ["GHSA-c39q-75j3-4qgf", "CVE-2026-108751"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.14, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2d15eb84-cc75-3f1e-8901-0018380b9dab", "product": {"name": "moai-adk", "vendor": {"name": "modu-ai"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.1.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "97bc2a31-4bda-3e42-a94e-da5fa2ef9ddc", "vendor": {"name": "modu-ai"}}], "isExploited": false}